---
import foodImage from "@/assets/images/crepe.jpg";

import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import PageHeader from "@/components/PageHeader.astro";
import Footer from "@/components/Footer.astro";
import RecipeForm from "@/components/RecipeForm";
---

<Layout>
  <PageHeader title="RSVP" />

  <section
    id="content"
    class="flex flex-col items-center justify-start gap-8 p-6 sm:gap-12 sm:p-12 sm:px-82 w-full"
  >
    <div
      class="flex flex-col items-center justify-start gap-6 max-w-3xl font-(family-name:--font-providence) text-mauve-950"
    >
      <p class="intro-para text-left font-light">
        We love sharing great food with others, and are so excited to celebrate
        our wedding with you by tucking into some delicious dishes. In the
        spirit of sharing, we would love to collect recipes from our guests to
        create a special recipe guestbook that captures the flavours and
        memories of our wedding day.
      </p>
      <p class="intro-para text-left font-light">
        We're not necessarily asking for a recipe from <i>every</i> guest, but would
        love for at least one recipe from each family or group of friends attending.
        This way, we can create a diverse and meaningful collection of recipes that
        truly represents the people who are important to us. If you have a favorite
        dish, a family recipe, or a culinary creation that holds special meaning to
        you, we would be thrilled to include it in our collection.
      </p>
      <p class="text-center text-pretty text-2xl sm:px-8">
        So, if you have a recipe that you'd like to share, please take a moment
        to fill out the form below, or email <a
          href="mailto:carolinaj215@hotmail.com"
          class="inline underline text-crimson">carolinaj215@hotmail.com</a
        >.
        <br />
        Pictures encouraged!
      </p>

      <RecipeForm client:load />
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  #content {
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .intro-para {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
</style>
